  "proposed_rules": [
    "Cut lone dragons in the first row unless they pair: no-open median T3 / p75 T5 (n=6734 cuts); after an opponent has opened, median T5 (n=2674 cuts); never cut 17.4% and paired before cut 12.1% (n=11391).",
    "Clean lone value winds on nearly the same clock: no-open median T3 / p75 T5 (n=3879 cuts); with any opponent open, median T6 (n=1673 cuts); never cut 16.5% and paired before cut 11.2% (n=6649).",
    "Treat guest winds as early cleanup first, safety second: median cut T1 / p75 T3 (n=7838 cuts), but 14.8% survived past turn 6 among eligible starts (n=8358).",
    "When nobody is threatening, matching already-seen honors is much more acceptable by turns 4-6: 0-visible cut rate 33.0% (n=15388) vs 1-visible 22.8% (n=13900).",
    "By turns 7-9 with no threat, stop treating live first-copy honors as automatic cuts: 0-visible cut rate 38.2% (n=3672) vs 1-visible 31.9% (n=6490).",
    "Under riichi, be stricter with live honors: turns 7-9 cut rates are 0-visible 14.3% (n=1483) and 1-visible 34.8% (n=1955); turns 10-12 are 0-visible 13.8% (n=1350) and 1-visible 37.3% (n=1886).",
